# 32. HARD SAFETY RULES

Implement these as non-bypassable safeguards unless explicitly enabled in ADMIN settings:

1. Never exceed max trade risk.
2. Never exceed max daily loss.
3. Never average down automatically.
4. Never increase position because of a losing trade.
5. Never exceed maximum correlated exposure.
6. Never allow a runner to have unlimited downside.
7. Never ignore expiration risk.
8. Never size based only on option premium.
9. Never round position size upward.
10. Never allow a profitable trade to return to unrestricted initial risk.
11. Disable new trades after daily risk limit is reached.
12. Log every automated decision.

